                "claim": "rotateLog is best effort and unsynchronized: concurrent triggers can both stat a full log, and the second rename can move a freshly started log to .1, displacing an older file. This is documented in the comment and loses no line being written, so it is a minor, accepted limitation. No test covers rename-failure behavior.",
