            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 22 manifest paths. Rotation, the 0600 narrowing, bounded stderr copy, line quoting and the non-absolute state dir refusal are each pinned by an externally observable test in engine/synctrigger/hardening_test.go and by re-recorded goldens in engine/cmd/testdata/synctrigger-golden.",
              "The parent and child both open the log via openLog, so the absolute-path guard applies to both; the RunChild guard in synctrigger.go also stops a default binary under a relative dir. The new golden for no HOME shows stderr error:log, exit 0 and an empty directory, consistent with the always-exit-0 contract.",
